0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Destinations"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"9+ Cheapest Countries for Indian Students to Study Abroad-2022 list"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"It is feasible to study abroad on a budget, believe it or not! Some of the best places to study abroad also have inexpensive, if not non-existent, tuition fees. Here’s everything you need to know about the top ten cheapest countries for Indian students to study abroad. Czech Republic In the Czech Republic, you can benefit from inexpensive tuition and living costs."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","You can study for free in public universities if you have a strong command of the Czech language, as degrees offered in Czech do not require a tuition charge. The average tuition for English-taught degrees at public institutions ranges from 0 to 20,110 EUR per year, depending on the university and specialisation.",{"children":"You can study for free in public universities if you have a strong command of the Czech language, as degrees offered in Czech do not require a tuition charge. The average tuition for English-taught degrees at public institutions ranges from 0 to 20,110 EUR per year, depending on the university and specialisation."}],["$","p","The tuition fee is the same whether you are an EU/EEA student or a non-EU/EEA student. Private institutions normally charge higher tuition since they can charge anything they want.",{"children":"The tuition fee is the same whether you are an EU/EEA student or a non-EU/EEA student. Private institutions normally charge higher tuition since they can charge anything they want."}],["$","p","When compared to most Western European countries, living expenditures in the Czech Republic are significantly lower. Students spend an average of 315 to 675 EUR per month on all expenses, including housing, food, transportation, and social activities.",{"children":"When compared to most Western European countries, living expenditures in the Czech Republic are significantly lower. Students spend an average of 315 to 675 EUR per month on all expenses, including housing, food, transportation, and social activities."}],["$","p","Norway",{"children":"Norway"}],["$","p","Norway is one of the most affordable countries for Indian students to study in. Its public schools are free to all students. Yes! Yes, you read that correctly. In Norway, there are no tuition fees. That does not, however, imply that you can remain there for free. Living in Norway can be a bit excessive in actuality. To join the student union, you must pay between Rs.3000 and Rs.5000. The student union fee includes things like health, cultural events, and counselling.",{"children":"Norway is one of the most affordable countries for Indian students to study in. Its public schools are free to all students. Yes! Yes, you read that correctly. In Norway, there are no tuition fees. That does not, however, imply that you can remain there for free. Living in Norway can be a bit excessive in actuality. To join the student union, you must pay between Rs.3000 and Rs.5000. The student union fee includes things like health, cultural events, and counselling."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b"],"$L1c"]}]]}],"$L1d"]}]}],"$L1e"]}],["$L1f"],"$L20"]}],"isPartial":"$@21","staleTime":"$22","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L23","isPartial":"$@24","staleTime":"$22","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L25","isPartial":"$@26","staleTime":"$22","varyParams":"$27"},{"rsc":"$L28","isPartial":"$@29","staleTime":"$22","varyParams":"$27"},{"rsc":"$L2a","isPartial":"$@2b","staleTime":"$22","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@2c","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@2d"}
